lled gap changes the fingerprint and creates a new version; a routine schedule does not invent a new conclusion.\"}]\n23:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-cstd-code-sample\":true,\"data-cstd-code-tone\":\"light\",\"className\":\"mt-8 overflow-hidden bg-[#0a0c0e] text-[#d9f9ff] shadow-[12px_12px_0_#e3b800]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-white/10 px-5 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#24e0ff]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":[\"REUSE KEY\",\" / \",\"text\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{\"value\":\"result_key = template_version + evidence_fingerprint\",\"label\":\"Copy code\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"figure\",null,{\"data-rehype-pretty-code-figure\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"pre\",null,{\"tabIndex\":\"0\",\"data-language\":\"text\",\"data-theme\":\"github-dark-dimmed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"code\",null,{\"data-language\":\"text\",\"data-theme\":\"github-dark-dimmed\",\"style\":{\"display\":\"grid\"},\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"data-line\":\"\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"result_key = template_version + evidence_fingerprint\"}]}]}]}]}]]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"stale\",\"className\":\"scroll-mt-28 border-t border-black/15 py-12 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-[#0b6473]\",\"children\":\"STALE\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-4xl\",\"children\":\"Stale callbacks must lose write authority\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"cstd-mdx-prose cstd-mdx-prose-light\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"A run token is created with each job and atomically claimed before publication. Once a newer run supersedes it, an old callback may be logged but cannot overwrite the latest report.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"This also fixes an easy-to-miss interface problem: completed is not the same as current. An old job may finish after it has stopped being the report a user is looking at. Showing the run token, version, and publication time together makes that difference visible.\"}]]}]]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Curated paths\",\"className\":\"mt-14 border-t border-black/20 pt-7\",\"data-cstd-note-paths\":true,\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-[11px] font-black text-black/55\",\"children\":\"CURATED PATHS\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",\"evidence-first-ai\",{\"href\":\"/en/topics/evidence-first-ai\",\"className\":\"group border-l-2 border-[#0b6473] py-1 pl-4 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-black/70 transition-colors hover:border-black hover:text-black\",\"children\":[\"02\",\" / \",\"Evidence-first AI\"]}]]}]]}]\n28:null\n11:300\n11:C\n1d:0\n13:\"$undefined\"\n15:\"$undefined\"\n18:\"$undefined\"\n1a:\"$undefined\"\n1c:\"$undefined\"\n10:\"$undefined\"\n"}}